Package: bareun
Title: R Interface for Bareun Korean NLP
Version: 1.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kihyun", "Yoon", , "gih2yun@baikal.ai", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("hunbL", , , "hunbl@baikal.ai", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0951-2785")))
Description: Client for the Bareun Korean natural language processing
    server <https://bareun.ai>. Provides part-of-speech tagging, spelling
    and spacing correction, homonym sense disambiguation, and phoneme-level
    search of the Urimalsaem Korean dictionary. Requires a running Bareun
    server and an API key.
